# Claude Code
# .claude/settings.json, skills/, agents/ and rules/ ARE committed — they are the
# team-shared agent configuration. Everything listed here is per-developer or
# runtime state and must never be committed.
#
# Deliberately a denylist, not `.claude/*` plus an allowlist: a stray runtime file
# turning up in `git status` is loud and fixable, whereas a new legitimate config
# file being silently skipped is the failure we are fixing here.
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/worktrees/
**/.claude/routines/.state/
**/.claude/checkpoints/
**/.claude/mailbox/
**/.claude/.cc-writes/
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
**/.claude/agent-registry.json
**/.claude/agent-memory-local
**/.claude/first-run
**/.claude/assistant-daemon-state.json
